---
// The sea of a category hub (F13b, decision 7; UX-15 A, hub-sea.html ?alt=a; DECISOES § 378 and § 575): at the foot of the
// band (.fo-hubband--sea), the crest in the full colour of the category, the water with the footer's wave and the Oli swim,
// 72 px, half under water on the right, looking left at the H1. All of it in one aria-hidden block with no pointer events:
// nothing to focus, no text under the water. The page lists 'swim' in BaseLayout's `oli`, so its symbol is in the sprite.
import Oli from './Oli.astro';
---
<div class="fo-hubband__sea" aria-hidden="true"><span class="fo-hubband__crest"></span><span class="fo-hubband__water"></span><Oli pose="swim" class="fo-hubband__oli" /></div>
